{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_blackd_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_blackd_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"希瓦艾什的影子","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blackd_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"a8cf6658be6d4da78c349b8f222f04893a53724ef26332187698f8f6790345b3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪山上的阳光照耀在洁白的雪地上，反射出耀眼的光芒。\n风声在山间呼啸，夹杂着圣山之上传来的钟声以及诵经声，似乎在讲述着无数古老的故事。\n时间在此间如同静止一般，仿佛这里自亘古之初开始，就是这样一副样貌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从脚印的深浅来看，这一带的积雪比预计的要深一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前阵子这边有局部降雪，山体原本就比较陡峭，让雪堆积起来的话......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我没记错，老爷刚刚聘请的专家好像说过，未来几天可能会有强降雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带一支队伍测量一下这边的积雪厚度，然后请专家看一下山体的坡度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"判断一下这里发生雪崩的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后......等递完这个消息后，我再向老爷汇报吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着眼前的光景，魏斯忍不住皱了皱眉头。\n身着先进铠甲、手持锐利兵刃的战士们，此时锐意全失，毫无组织。\n他们大部分躺在地上哀嚎，只有少数还有力气的，恨恨地看向“始作俑者”——一名金发的高挑女性。\n看到女性身边的老者时，他微微挑了一下眉毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是，您不愿意赏脸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是带着这群崽子在这里练兵而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么让你宴请的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐为了训练我希瓦艾什家的战士日夜操劳，我也只是想尽一些绵薄之力罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在为希瓦艾什家训练这帮崽子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们未来也不会为你服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷让我给你递个消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要见一个人，需要你在场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷正在家里等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天就先到这里，解散吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就听说，老爷身边这位油盐不进，今天算是见识到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文叔，您不该来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该来的，这个闭门羹啊，得吃了才能死心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，原本我就想和你聊聊。魏斯啊，借一步说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文叔想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就直说了，魏斯，你怎么看锏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很强，有她在身边，老爷确实安全了许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是个聪明孩子，魏斯，你知道我问的不是这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想知道我的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷带着她回来后，就把你原本的位置给抢走了，你心里当真就没有半点想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的想法......不重要，老爷的事业能够发展起来，我心中总是高兴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文叔呢？听您的口气，您好像不太喜欢锏小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说她是什么地方的三届冠军之类的，今天亲眼见到，确实是个了不起的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，花了那么大的价钱就为了买下这样一个人，还把她摆在这么重要的一个位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要说一句不好听的，老爷他啊，有点想当然了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文叔，注意言辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这小子，还是这么护着他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着老爷长大，他也得和你一样，喊我一声艾德文叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜有多少人这么想？他们只是不敢说罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不会猜不到，老爷是为了进入维多利亚的社交场才这么做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，把她留在维多利亚不就好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他难道忘了在谢拉格还有你这样一个贴身侍卫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把她带回来，你会怎么想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的想法并不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是个谦虚的孩子，你也许会这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷外出求学这几年，佩尔罗契家和布朗陶家就差骑在我们头上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少人倒向了他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希瓦艾什家现在这点地是谁争取来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是切斯特老爷，是马特洪，是你，是我们这些老东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你不这么想，你觉得，有多少人会嫉妒、会不满？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒不是针对这个锏，她这样心高气傲的年轻人，我见得多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的人，有一个两个，是没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，老爷从维多利亚带回来的那些年轻人啊，怕是要把我们这些老骨头给生吞咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷从来不会厚此薄彼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷当然没有冷落我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这就够了吗？这些小年轻，凭什么跟我们平起平坐？凭什么骑在我们头上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为希瓦艾什家付出了这么多，现在要我们给他们让路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，老爷认为他们有相应的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"价值？呵，就像我的二儿子那样，学了点技术，就以为谢拉格的未来掌握在自己的手上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷难道真的相信，这样不知天高地厚的人，能够为谢拉格的未来做些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文叔，您就这么确定，我会站在您这边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷外出求学的这几年，我看着你和马特洪为了这个家族尽心尽力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算不为我身边的几个老朋友，只为你们两个年轻人，这话我也是要说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，就算你转头就告诉老爷了又有何妨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕老爷今天亲自来我面前，我也会这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是啊，年轻人总是不听劝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想拿锏小姐开刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷也好，他身边的那些年轻人也好，他们需要知道，谢拉格的主人还轮不到那群外来人来当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而镇住一群羽兽最简单的方法，就是把出头的那一只......解决掉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，调查结果出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"专家怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也是老爷信任的人，直接说就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。专家说你的判断是对的，那边的山体已经相当危险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果未来还会降雪的话，发生雪崩的可能性很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我倒希望是我错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能在这个阶段发现已经是不幸中的万幸了，得亏是队长你的经验丰富，不然就晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这应该要立即向老爷汇报吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这件事我去汇报就好，你们先继续观测吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的样子，你想到了什么，魏斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文叔的意思我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这么关心希瓦艾什家的未来，我很感动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道，你这孩子肯定是会理解我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，我有一个主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您刚才也听到了，近期可能会发生一场雪崩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会请示老爷，让锏小姐在雪崩区域附近的地方练兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到雪崩发生时，再请求支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"届时，在雪崩中会发生什么，就谁也不知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧啧，了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是我也听到了你和你手下说的话，我都要怀疑你是不是早就准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，我明白了，你也早有此意，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，别人不知道，我是知道的，你这孩子心里傲得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会甘心自己的位置被抢走呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我确实等您这样对希瓦艾什忠心耿耿的人很久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在说到“希瓦艾什”的时候，魏斯加重了一下音调，老者没有发现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，我今天在递消息的时候，发现月牙峰那一带很有可能会出现一场雪崩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有几成把握？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结合我最近学习的气象学知识还有地理知识，我有九成把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们队伍里的专家分析的结果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就全权交给你来处理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，以后可以不用叫我老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个习惯，可不好改过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我可能要向您借用一下锏小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看着办就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，前提是你说得动她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我尽力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我今天遇到了艾德文叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？我听说，老艾德文最近还挺活跃，他说了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他精神看起来不错，还托我向您问好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"数日后"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯，大老远地把我这把老骨头喊到这里来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事想和您谈谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事？锏的事你已经安排下去了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，您尽管放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，为什么我一路上都没看到这座村子里有几个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，这很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手下挨家挨户地说服村民们去避难了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在留在村子里的，应该都是一些顽固派了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顽固派？避难？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，如果您的消息灵通一些，或许我还要费点力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果，您就这样直接来了，倒显得我的一些布置多余了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你算计我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算计，说不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您之前不是听到了，这阵子可能会有雪崩吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座村子，就是雪崩即将淹没的村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你疯了，魏斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想过你会把这件事告诉恩希欧迪斯，但我没想到，你竟然会这么做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这么说我就不懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我喊到这里来，还不让我走，安的什么心难道还用我说吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您以为，我把您喊到“耶拉冈德的翻身”即将覆盖之处是为了灭口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不是吗？！你这小子，好狠毒的心啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，放在过去，任何一个谢拉格人都会这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就有话直说了，艾德文叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要杀您的话，我不用费这么大的力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拆除工作进行得如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，临近山体方向的建筑群全部清扫完毕，现在已经清理出了一片巨大的场地，可以用来组建防线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，和预想的一样，遭到了一些不愿意离开的居民的抗议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疏散情况呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分居民听从我们的安排选择了疏散，但是还有一些较为顽固的居民不愿意相信我们的说辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，你要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去请锏小姐出手。"},{"type":"narration","text":"老迈的贵族已经顾不上魏斯在说什么了，他急着想要逃离房间。\n然而，魏斯的双手牢牢地抓住他的双肩，几乎是推着，将老人臃肿的身躯推到了战士身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我离开一会儿，你们“照顾”好艾德文叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，艾德文叔，您不会死的，至少今天不会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐，有件事需要请你帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"气喘吁吁的，看起来不是小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我们的预测，附近的月牙峰那里可能会出现一场雪崩，想要请你帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是，你真的需要我帮忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的小队已经做好了防御手段，有些坚持留在那里的居民想请你和你的部下帮忙保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没记错的话，恩希欧迪斯给了你那支小队足够的权限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以你的聪明才智，怎么可能留下这么大一个缺口，特意来搬我这个救兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我们的人手不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，我还真有些好奇，你何必为了我大费周章？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候，我偶尔也会和角峰大哥吵架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的时候一赌气，我就会躲进山里。但是，最后肚子饿了，我总是会灰溜溜地回到家里，吃他做的饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从那时起我就懂了一个道理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许外面的天地很大，但是，谢拉格并不大。无论白天在外面做了些什么，等到晚上，我们总是要在一张桌子上吃饭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候，如果彼此之间还有嫌隙，未免也太尴尬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"列队，准备去救灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士们","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还真是一对好主仆，你在这方面也和恩希欧迪斯一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，我就当作是夸赞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你倒是提醒我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪崩啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然，总是要在一张桌子上吃饭的，你的叫法未免太生分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换一个吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就......麻烦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏姐。"},{"type":"narration","text":"锏没有回头，不过也没有反驳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后......该去解决另一个问题了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她愿意帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，只要她愿意帮忙做些什么，乡亲们一定会对她改观的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是不愿意，只是......她也需要一个契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文叔呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾德文阁下已经冷静下来了，还问我要了一杯热茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是艾德文叔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，哪怕老爷站在我的面前，我也会那么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是被你这人精平日里摆出的面孔给骗了，误以为你是可以拉拢的人。我认栽，要杀要剐，随你的便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道您是这样的人，所以才会设这个局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，您早就死在雪山上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，我现在反倒是有些好奇你想做什么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从一开始，你就是在给锏创造舞台？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺势而为罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么要为她做到这一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您以己度人地认为，我也会讨厌锏姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是十年前，我或许确实会这样。但是，我很早就抛弃了这样的情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能为老爷出力的方式有许多种，我并不拘泥于护卫这一种方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不如说，如果我真的这么想，那老爷一定会对我很失望吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了，你不恨锏倒也罢了，居然还帮助她？她未必承你的情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一开始，我只是信任把她带回来的老爷而已，她确实是个不好相处的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，当你理解她的冷漠并不是敌意，而是不在乎，甚至是一种茫然的时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实你是不会害怕她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定没有见过她在山野林间，偶尔被一些放牧的大叔拉着聊家常时，那副有些无奈却又选择了忍耐的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您见过，您一定也会像我一样，想让她被更多人理解并接纳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她被谢拉格接纳的话，对谢拉格而言，对她而言，以及对老爷而言，我认为都是一件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于她承不承我的情，又有什么关系呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩希欧迪斯知道你做了这些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了实现自己的蓝图，老爷不得不采取一些雷霆手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多反弹都在他的意料之内，只是，他的精力并不是无限的，无法一一应对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在力所能及的范围内为他分忧罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于老爷知不知道......实际上一点都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来吧，艾德文叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您马上就会知道，在老爷的眼里，从很久以前开始，就不再只有一个希瓦艾什家了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"老者感觉雪崩不再重要了。\n因为出现在他眼前的，是一片宽阔的原野，他隐约记得，这里曾有一些居民的房屋，然而此时，它们已经被夷为平地。\n而伫立在原野之上的，是十几辆重型卡车。卡车上载有重型器械，其上的机械臂经过不断变形、组装、连接——\n最后，化作了一道钢铁壁障。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这到底是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向您介绍一下吧，艾德文叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前也说过，我为了给老爷送信，常年在谢拉格的山间奔走，因此，我对于谢拉格的山和雪都非常熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷一回到谢拉格，就授权我组建一支雪崩预警小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这支队伍中，聚集了跟随老爷回到谢拉格的气象学家、地质学家等，在这些专家的帮助下，我们才得以准确预测这一次雪崩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以我们现在的能力无法阻止大规模的雪崩。但是，如果在它还没成形时提前定点引爆，或许可以引发较小规模的雪崩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此一来，就能达到防止大规模雪崩发生的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别太谦虚，队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一开始，我们还纠结于以我们的人力物力，就算能够预测雪崩，也无法顺利阻止，只能预警。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你提出了这个方案，我们都觉得这是个了不起的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中间的大量计算还要仰仗队伍里的专家，我只是提供了一个点子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"防止大规模雪崩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，您眼前就是阻拦雪崩的防线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未来，它会变得更加坚固。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那时，所有人都将可以站在您现在的位置观察祂的“翻身”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而今天，您有幸第一个获得了坐在特等席的机会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看，开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一开始，只是山脊处的一小块积雪突然松动，滑落而下。然而，随着那块雪体的坠落，一声低沉的轰鸣开始在山谷间回荡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"顷刻之间，这道细流变得狂暴，仿佛被一股无形的力量推动，树木被连根拔起，巨石被卷入雪流中，发出震耳欲聋的巨响。\n雪崩的速度惊人，仿佛整个山体都在向下倾泻。所过之处，雪与冰交织成一幅壮丽而又恐怖的画面。\n在过去，这是令所有谢拉格人闻风丧胆的画面，见者无不唯恐避之不及。\n然而，这一次，山脚下却有一群人，用充满信心的目光迎向它，只因他们相信自己搭建的钢铁城墙。\n只因他们誓要挑战这亘古不变的权威。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"冰雪构成的洪流猛烈地冲击到了由卡车构成的防线上。\n在自然的力量面前，即使是比人类重了数千倍的卡车似乎也显得十分渺小，它们被冲击得不断后退，有几辆甚至倒了下去。\n然而，人类的智慧终究还是起了作用。\n随着钢铁防线不断向后推移，冰雪洪流的冲击力终于还是被减弱了。\n防线被冲退的速度也在不断地放慢，直到最后，一辆卡车缓缓地停在了魏斯和老者面前十几米处。\n提前被引爆的雪崩......就这样被拦住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未来，这道防线将通过即将建成的铁路，在最短的时间里抵达谢拉格的每一个角落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经，“耶拉冈德的翻身”令所有谢拉格人闻之色变，不知道有多少人因此丧生或者失去住所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，在不远的将来，谢拉格人可以像您现在这样坐在这里，看着这样一场雪崩被我们的防线挡下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在过去能够想象这样的事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，您不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而——它正在发生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老者的围巾早已被吹飞，他的须发上也沾满冰雪。但除此之外，他毫发无伤。\n整个过程中，魏斯的双手依然死死钳住老者的双肩，不让他有丝毫逃离的空间。\n但是，如果老者此时尚且保有一丝冷静的话，他只消侧一下头就能发现，魏斯此刻的注意力根本不在他的身上。\n他全神贯注地看着那道在他的指挥下构成的钢铁防线，而施加在老者肩膀上的力道，完全是兴奋所致。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是应该在协助居民撤退吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么从山上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你背上的两位难道是——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说有一对夫妻来不及逃难，我就直接去找他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点，把两位送去治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的谢拉格战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......太谢谢你了，锏姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪崩，确实挺有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先回去了，下次也可以喊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......一个人冲进了雪崩里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老实说，这也超出了我的预料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想，您应该明白了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些外乡人之所以能够骑在您的头上，是因为他们确实掌握了远超谢拉格想象的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好想想，艾德文叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和您背后那些叔叔婶婶，是想要被这洪流给碾过去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是坐在上面，看着曾经无法想象的事物被自己征服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还有上车的权利吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷欢迎每一位愿意一起打造新的谢拉格的人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"老者沉默了一会儿，终于艰难地点了点头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我真是老咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还不老，谢拉格还需要您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。我会回去想一想，和他们聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就麻烦您了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"魏斯的脸上再次浮现出笑容。\n老者见过无数次魏斯的笑容，他知道，很多时候，魏斯的这种笑容，只是一种自卫手段。\n但这一次，魏斯是真心的。\n笑容在阳光下熠熠生辉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
